    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "TPCC 目标业务 TPS（场景可选：基线 → 压力 → 调优后）",
      "description": "在顶部“场景”下拉框选择一个焦点场景，仅显示该场景运行期间的目标业务 TPS 折线（不包含未运行时的 0 值）；依次覆盖基线、压力调优前和压力调优后。默认显示最近 6 小时；在图上拖拽选中一次运行即可放大查看变化。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (scenario_id) (sysinsight_dream_lab_tpcc_business_tps{scenario_id=\"$scenario\", phase=~\"baseline|pressure_before|pressure_after\"})",
          "range": true,
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "目标业务 TPS"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#5794F2"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisLabel": "目标业务 TPS",
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
